  id: RiverLongshipYard
  displayName: Longship Yard
  description: A long timber hall and a dragon-prowed longship on its rollers. Trains
    Longships; its ferry seats 6. Build it on the shore of open water. Its boats
    patrol the water and shoot at raiders near the shore; send troops to land the
    water cuts off and its ferry carries them across.
